'''Tomboy Lion Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] added in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]] that can be obtained from the [[Heartbeat Catcademy (Event Gacha)|Heartbeat Catcademy]] [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 651
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Tomboy Lion Cat
|name2 = Iron-Masked Lion Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Iron-Masked Lion Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Tomboy Lion Cat is fast in both attacks and movement, so her usage is similar to that of the normal [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]]. The issue lies in her stats: early in the game, not enough + levels can realistically be obtained to make up for the level cap being 1, while later on her stats will instead be insufficient, regardless of level or her ability.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump & Rusher}}

