==Trivia==
*Her appearance is a reference to a common trope in anime and manga, where a student is late for class, so they run to school while holding whatever they had for breakfast with their mouth, usually bread or toast.
*Iron-Masked Lion Cat is a reference to Yoko Godai from the television series [[wikipedia:Sukeban Deka#Television series|''Sukeban Deka II: The Legend of the Girl In The Iron Mask'']], a schoolgirl who spent most of her life wearing a similar iron mask. Even her uniform has the same exact colors.

